   <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Mid-month moves typically cost fifteen to twenty percent less than month-end relocations, when corporate transfers and student shifts create intense demand.</span></li>
   <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Month-end bookings often trigger dynamic pricing, inflated vehicle charges, and rushed service fees across most Hyderabad to Kurnool transport providers.</span></li>
   </ul>
   <p>Securing your service well before the actual moving date unlocks substantial advance reservation discounts. Reputable packers and movers reward early commitments with reduced tariffs and guaranteed vehicle allocation.</p>
   <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
   <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Booking thirty to forty five days ahead usually qualifies you for early-bird price locks and waived loading fees.</span></li>
   <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Confirm your inventory list early so companies can calculate accurate cubic footage and prevent last-minute volume upcharges.</span></li>
   </ul>
   <p>Understanding milestone payment schedules protects your budget and prevents unexpected financial strain during the actual transit phase. Transparent billing structures ensure you only pay for verified services.</p>
   <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
   <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Request a clear breakdown that separates advance booking fees, loading charges, highway tolls, and final delivery payments.</span></li>
   <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Avoid providers demanding full upfront payment instead opting for staged releases tied to packing completion, vehicle dispatch, and successful unloading.</span></li>
   <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Always insist on a receipt for every transaction milestone to maintain financial accountability throughout the Hyderabad to Kurnool route.</span></li>
   </ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



